                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*  PROGRAM    :  W0201800                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNKTION   :  MATCHAR W01160 OCH W22508                             *        
*                SORTERAR BORT ARTIKLAR MED FKNGRP 8616 8614           *        
*                OCH REDIRLEV > 0 = BUMPERS                            *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FÖRFATTARE :  BODIL LINDAHL                                         *        
*                                                                      *        
*  DATUM      :  SEPTEMBER 2009                                        *        
*                                                                      *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*                                                                               
FILE W02018D1                                                                   
%W01160                                                                         
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
FILE W02018D2                                                                   
%W02008                                                                         
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
FILE W02018D3 FB (30 27960)                                                     
%W02008    'UT-'                                                                
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT (W02018D1 KEY(CLAG-IDARTNR) W02018D2 KEY(IDARTNR))     +              
                                                                                
    IF MATCHED                                                                  
      IF (CLAG-IDFKNGRP = 8616 OR                           +                   
          CLAG-IDFKNGRP = 8614 OR                           +                   
          KDPRODSL = 16 )     AND                           +                   
         (CLAG-REDIRLEV GT 0)                                                   
        CONTINUE                                                                
      ELSE                                                                      
        PERFORM S01-SKRIV-POST                                                  
      END-IF                                                                    
    END-IF                                                                      
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
 S01-SKRIV-POST.  PROC                                                          
    PUT W02018D3 FROM W02018D2                                                  
    END-PROC                                                                    
*                                                                               
